       universal_robots_ur10e; everything else (Robotiq 2F-85, work table, vial contact
       classes, pocket wells, cameras, keyframe layout) is byte-consistent with the UR5e
       deployment cell so the capture/eval pipeline transfers unchanged. Joint, body,
       actuator, and site NAMES are identical to the UR5e cell — the browser harness,
       GR00T bridge, and IK expert are all keyed on names, not geometry. -->
